graph TD
    A[Student Login] --> B[Browse NME Courses]
    B --> C{Check Seat Availability}
    C -- Seats > 0 --> D[Check Schedule Clash]
    D -- No Clash --> E[Confirm Registration & Decrement Seat]
    E --> F[Broadcast Seat Count via Socket.io]
    E --> G[Generate Registration Slip & QR Code]
    C -- Seats = 0 --> H[Add to Waiting List]
    H --> I[Wait for Drop Event]
    I -- Drop Event Occurs --> J[Auto-promote First Waitlisted Student]
